{"id": "ctl-url-mismatch", "class": "control", "goal": "open_url", "request": "open wikipedia", "act": {"url_contains": "wikipedia"}, "expect": {"url_contains": "youtube"}, "control": "wrong URL — the action succeeds and the expectation names a different site, so a correct verifier must say UNMET"}
