{"id": "ctl-stale-automation", "class": "control", "goal": "run_automation", "request": "run a system health check", "act": {"automation_id": "aries.health"}, "expect": {"automation_id": "aries.news"}, "control": "action issued against a different automation — health runs, news does not, so a correct verifier must say UNMET for news inside this window"}
